=== PARITY (vs web JourneyDetailsPanel.tsx) ===
  Data sources -> useTranslation only. The web source is a pure presentational leaf taking a non-optional
    prop { drive: DriveDetail }. The native surface binds the P1/S8 JourneyDetailsSource carrying the
    parent's drive snapshot + the display context the web pulls from hooks at render (the
    `DateTime in="vehicle"` IANA timezone + the `fmtNumber` locale + global precision=2). The view does
    NO HTTP.
  Projection -> 1:1 port of the web inline branches, all unit-tested + EXECUTED green:
    (a) primary per endpoint: truthy (non-empty) address -> address; else `lat && lon` (BOTH non-nil AND
        non-zero, JS truthiness) -> "fmtNumber(lat)°N|S, fmtNumber(abs(lon))°E|W" rendered monospaced
        (web font-mono); else fallback.
    (b) web QUIRK reproduced verbatim: latitude is NOT Math.abs'd (keeps its sign, e.g. "-33.87°S"), only
        the longitude is abs'd.
    (c) 0 / nil short-circuits the coordinate to the fallback (JS falsy).
    (d) battery "{pct ?? '?'}%" -> raw value incl 0, else "?".
    (e) destination fallback: endTs present -> "No address data", absent -> "In progress".
    (f) destination timestamp: endTs ? formatted : "In progress"; start timestamp always formatted
        ("—" when nil, the web formatDateTime null path).
  Composition -> web header `<h3>` (lucide Navigation, text-cyan -> location.north.fill / Color.TS.accent)
    + "Journey Details"; web `grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2` -> LazyVGrid(.adaptive minimum 240); Start cell
    (lucide MapPin/green -> mappin.circle.fill / Color.TS.statusSuccess) + Destination cell (lucide
    Flag/red -> flag.fill / Color.TS.statusDanger). Per cell: bold primary (text-primary), muted
    timestamp (text-muted), secondary battery (text-secondary). Whole panel wrapped in TSFadeIn>TSGlassPanel
    (web <FadeIn><GlassPanel>).
  Shared components -> @/components/ui GlassPanel -> TSGlassPanel; @/components/motion FadeIn -> TSFadeIn;
    @/components/data-display DateTime -> DateFormatter setLocalizedDateFormatFromTemplate("yMMMdjjmm") in
    the vehicle tz + locale (Apple-HIG idiomatic peer of the web year/month-short/day + 2-digit
    hour:minute); fmtNumber -> NumberFormatter(.decimal, grouping, min=max fraction=precision, locale).
    Skeleton chrome -> TSSkeleton; retry -> TSButton. Compiled against the REAL apps/apple component
    library in the iOS-18 + macOS-15 typechecks below. Recharts -> none / Leaflet -> none.
  States (all render) -> loading (skeleton grid) · content (the journey panel) · empty (resolved with no
    drive -> friendly hint, never a blank box) · error (QueryError-equivalent + retry) · stale (freshness
    chip + banner over the cached journey + one-shot auto-refresh) · offline (chip + banner over the cached
